[statement]
As `an-upgrade-the-request-needs-reaches-an-installed-dependent`, without
`app` 2.0: the installed `app` cannot stay beside `lib` 2.0 and nothing
replaces it, so the request is refused.

[repository]
P:app
V:1.0-r0
D:lib<2

P:lib
V:1.0-r0

P:lib
V:2.0-r0

P:foo
V:1.0-r0
D:lib>=2

[installed]
P:lib
V:1.0-r0

P:app
V:1.0-r0
D:lib<2

[world]
app

[request]
foo

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
| ERROR: unable to select packages:
|   lib-1.0-r0:
|     breaks: foo-1.0-r0[lib>=2]
|     satisfies: app-1.0-r0[lib<2]
refused
